            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nI don't think including anything debug/breakpoint/DAP related to 'mini.nvim' makes sense before there is a relatively straightforward, organized, and documented way to deal with them. Either as 'mini.nvim' module or Neovim's built-in functionality (like with `vim.lsp`, for example). At the moment, I don't think any of these will happen, I am afraid.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned. But if you end up implementing any of them, would you mind making it somewhere public and linking it here? Maybe they will be useful for others.",
