            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "> Yeah, this looks similar to [what is done in 'ibhagwan/fzf-lua'](https://github.com/ibhagwan/fzf-lua/blob/9427dc65afaa7972fb20fc52280cd1449f691928/lua/fzf-lua/providers/dap.lua#L79).\r\n\r\nYeah either way, what you told initially stands right since dap.breakpoints module is not a complete one yet since the author wanted to add support for something called data breakpoints and will then probably work on providing a widget for toggling breakpoints. So since the api is not stable, there is probably no point in writing a picker as of now for it.",
